# What NEVER goes into the Docker image.
#
# Two reasons to exclude things: SECRETS (.env must reach the container
# at runtime via env_file, never baked into an image layer — images get
# pushed to registries and shared) and SIZE/CHURN (data folders are
# bind-mounted volumes; the venv and git history are dead weight).
.env
.git
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
instance/
uploads/
backups/
export/
.pytest_cache
.idea
.claude
